---
title: "copySessionCookies (stem-system middleware.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_iter: cookies = from.cookies.getAll()
    q_iter --> q_copy: for cookie in cookies
    q_copy --> q_iter: to.cookies.set(cookie.name, cookie.value)
    q_iter --> [*]: all cookies copied

    note right of q_copy
        INV-001: Every cookie from source response is copied to destination response
        INV-002: Cookie name and value are preserved without modification
    end note
